<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed slightly lower in active trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 1.15 to 6944.70.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.43 to 420.24.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.05.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1253 to 1205.</p>
<p>Volume was 522,481,410 compared 528,901,140 on Wednesday.</p>
